    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h3 id="JavaScript-→-TypesScript"><a href="#JavaScript-→-TypesScript" class="headerlink" title="JavaScript → TypesScript"></a>JavaScript → TypesScript</h3><p>以前はjavascriptで利用していた。<br>NoSQL方式で、オブジェクトをそのまま保存していたので超絶簡単だったが、<br>TypeScriptではどういう風に使うのだろうか？<br>どんな型でも保存できるのだろうか？</p><h3 id="結果"><a href="#結果" class="headerlink" title="結果"></a>結果</h3><p>型をanyにすれば良いだけだった・・・</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">async</span> <span class="title function_">load</span>(<span class="attr">path</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span>): <span class="title class_">Promise</span>&lt;<span class="built_in">any</span>&gt;&#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">res</span>: admin.<span class="property">database</span>.<span class="property">DataSnapshot</span> = <span class="keyword">await</span> admin.<span class="title function_">database</span>().<span class="title function_">ref</span>(path).<span class="title function_">once</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">return</span> res.<span class="title function_">val</span>();</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">async</span> <span class="title function_">save</span>(<span class="attr">path</span>: <span class="built_in">string</span>, <span class="attr">value</span>: <span class="built_in">any</span>): <span class="title class_">Promise</span>&lt;<span class="built_in">void</span>&gt;&#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">await</span> admin.<span class="title function_">database</span>().<span class="title function_">ref</span>(path).<span class="title function_">set</span>(value);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>保存するときも、どんな型でもそのまま保存してくれるみたい・・・</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> <span class="string">&quot;../base/utils&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">let</span> db = <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">FireBaseDataBase</span>();</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="title function_">async</span> () =&gt; &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">ins</span>: <span class="title class_">Instrument</span> = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">exchange</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;bitflyer&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">pair</span>:     <span class="string">&#x27;btc_jpy&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">min_amount</span>: <span class="number">0</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">min_price</span>: <span class="number">0</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">taker_fee</span>: <span class="number">0</span>,</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">maker_fee</span>: <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">  &#125;;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="attr">tk</span>: <span class="title class_">Ticker</span> = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">instrument</span>: ins,</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">best_ask</span>: <span class="number">123</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">best_bid</span>: <span class="number">456</span>,</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  &#125;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">await</span> db.<span class="title function_">save</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;/bot/bitbank/btc_jpy&#x27;</span>, tk)</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">let</span> val = <span class="keyword">await</span> db.<span class="title function_">load</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;/bot/bitbank/btc_jpy&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(val);</span><br><span class="line">  &#125;)();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]>
    </content>
